    </a>
    . Texts, images, screenshots and the CV remain the exclusive property of {site.name} — all
    rights reserved. Any reuse requires prior written permission.
  </p>

  <h2>Reporting content</h2>
  <p>
    For any question or report about the content of this site, write to{' '}
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <p class="meta">Last updated: 20 November 2026.</p>
</Base>
